3. Keyhole quadtree packet schema
----------------------------------
   proto/quadtreeset.proto describes the wire format of the quadtree packets
   served by kh.google.com and khmdb.google.com. Google has not published this
   schema: the Earth Enterprise open-source release includes dbroot_v2.proto
   but not quadtreeset, whose original internal name -- "quadtreeset.protodevel"
   -- survives in descriptors embedded in Google Earth client binaries.

   The field numbers, types and enum values were read out of the serialized
   FileDescriptorProto embedded in the protoc-generated C# shipped by
   GEHistoricalImagery (item 1 above), and transcribed into .proto source so
   that the schema is reviewable and the generated descriptor is reproducible.
   See tools/regen_descriptors.py.


